{"availability":"available","full":"zhinjs/zhin","name":"zhin","description":"AI-native TypeScript bot framework — one codebase for 20+ chat platforms (QQ, Discord, Telegram, Slack, WeChat…). Opt-in AI agent with MCP, tools & security policies. <10MB core.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":136,"forks":19,"created":"2022-08-17T01:12:28Z","updated":"2026-10-16T10:38:43Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"http://zhin.js.org/","topics":["a2a","agent","ai","bot-framework","chatbot","discord","framework","hot-module-replacement","im","mcp","multi-platform","openai","plugin","qq","slack","telegram","typescript-framework","wechat"],"demo":"https://demo.zhin.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:46.279Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:46.279Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:46.279Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:33.072Z","stars":136,"forks":19},{"at":"2026-10-17T21:14:47.786Z","stars":136,"forks":19},{"at":"2026-10-18T22:45:46.279Z","stars":136,"forks":19}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Write a chat bot once in TypeScript. Run it on 20+ platforms.","QQ · WeChat · WeCom · DingTalk · Lark · Discord · Telegram · Slack · KOOK · LINE · …","Zhin.js is a framework for building bots that live in chat apps — community bots, personal assistants, notification and support bots, AI chat assistants."],"features":["One codebase, many platforms. Adapters translate each platform into one unified message, so your commands and replies work everywhere. One bot can run many accounts on many platforms at once.","A feature is a file. commands/hello/index.ts is the /hello command. Middleware, message cards, scheduled jobs and AI tools work the same way — no registration boilerplate.","Small by default, AI when you want it. The IM core is under 10MB and needs no model key. Add LLMs, tools, memory and MCP with one command.","Hot reload that can't take you down. Save a file and the bot reloads. If the new code fails, the previous version keeps serving.","Managed from the browser. console.zhin.dev lets you send test messages, read logs, edit config and manage plugins — nothing to deploy."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zhinjs/zhin/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fec15aca60dbf5a8510398063980debf98001150e9eed3114fde45034873efaf","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:46.379Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:46.379Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Write a chat bot once in TypeScript. Run it on 20+ platforms.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zhinjs/zhin/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No platform account and no model key required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zhinjs/zhin/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fec15aca60dbf5a8510398063980debf98001150e9eed3114fde45034873efaf","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zhinjs/zhin/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:46.379Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T10:38:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zhinjs/zhin/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:46.380Z","hash":"fec15aca60dbf5a8510398063980debf98001150e9eed3114fde45034873efaf","originalBytes":12967,"storedBytes":12967,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:46.279Z","subjects":["MCP servers & agents","Chatbots & assistants"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["MCP servers & agents","Chatbots & assistants"],"evidence":[{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"AI agent"},{"subject":"Chatbots & assistants","source":"metadata","match":"chatbot"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Games & game development"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://demo.zhin.dev/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-17T21:36: